      "created_at": "2022-02-25T00:37:29.498Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have created and uploaded a character sheet for Foundry.</p>\n<p>It can be found here</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://foundryvtt.com/packages/scrpg\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0ded1199bfa629396089c207449c4752b90e9f59_2_500x500.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0ded1199bfa629396089c207449c4752b90e9f59_2_500x500.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0ded1199bfa629396089c207449c4752b90e9f59.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0ded1199bfa629396089c207449c4752b90e9f59.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0ded1199bfa629396089c207449c4752b90e9f59_2_10x10.png\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://foundryvtt.com/packages/scrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">foundryvtt.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://foundryvtt.com/packages/scrpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinel Comics the Roleplaying Game (unofficial) | Foundry Virtual Tabletop</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Sentinel Comics the Roleplaying Game (unofficial), a System available for Foundry Virtual Tabletop</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>It currently supports hero, villain, and environment character sheets.</p>\n<p>It also supports the hero archetypes divided, form-changer, minion-maker, and modular</p>",
